EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Since we have not received the information requested to get a modification in place we will have no choice but to move forward against you personally as well as the business. We would love the opportunity to work together on a repayment plan however with your refusal to send the documents required to do so we have no choice but to proceed on the contract.

If you would like to work together to resolve in the future please reach out and we will give you the balance at that time with all costs and fees incurred.

Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

